{
"text": "“Independence in politics is what we need in these times. We know what the crucial issues are (health care, housing, education, financial inequality) and we need elected representatives who are willing to work on these rather than bending to a party line for the benefit of a minority. Shawn Saindon is the candidate who will work for us.”",
"href": "https://www.midcoastvillager.com/voices/letters/shawn-saindon-for-maine/article_d0b816a8-b839-440e-9939-9d129fe583f2.html"
},
{
"text": "“Shawn is running a truly independent campaign because he believes his first responsibility is to the people of Hope, Union, and Warren — not to a political party or special interest group.”",
